    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86362.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Good morning, happy Monday, and welcome to the Blunt Post with Vic. I am your host, Vic Jorami, the editor and publisher of the Blunt Post. The Blunt Post with Vic is a program that covers national, regional, and local headline news, offers analysis and commentary, and I interview members of Congress, local elected officials, and other high-profile public figures. I'm very excited for my special guest today. He is an exceptional member of Congress, whom I admire very much. He's a genuine leader who fights tirelessly for the rights of all Americans and even people around the world. That's New Jersey Congressman Frank Palone. My interview with Congressman Palone is after the news and let's get blunt segments, so stay tuned. Here are some news items from over the weekend and this morning. The latest Covid variant is one and a half times more contagious than Amikron and already circulating in almost half of US states. The Amikron sub variant known as BA.2 is one and a half times more transmittable than the original Amikron strain according to Danish scientists. The UK Health Agency on Friday said BA.2 has a substantial growth advantage over the original Amikron known as BA.1. Nearly half of US states have confirmed the presence of BA.2 with at least 127 known cases nationwide as of Friday. The US has warned a Russian invasion of Ukraine would be horrific for both sides while calling for a diplomatic solution as tensions over Moscow's military buildup on the border of the country continued to simmer. Speaking at the Pentagon on Friday, top US officials urged a focus on diplomacy while saying that Russia now has enough troops and equipment in place to threaten the whole of Ukraine. On Friday, President Joe Biden said he would send a small number of U.S. troops to Eastern European and NATO countries in the near term. The Pentagon has already placed about 8,500 U.S. troops on standby for possible deployment to Europe amid Russia's military buildup near Ukraine's border.",
