      },
      {
        "text": "The U.S. response to Russia was coordinated with Ukraine and European allies and partners.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "We have proposed reciprocal transparency measures regarding force posture in Ukraine.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Three deliveries of U.S. defense and military assistance arrived in Kyiv this week.",
        "confidence": 0.96
